        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, pursuant to the terms of the Amgen Collaboration Agreement, we and Amgen have agreed to collaborate on the global clinical development and commercialization of a portfolio of Amgen clinical- and late-preclinical-stage oncology pipeline products.",
        "start_character": 76764,
        "end_character": 77023
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011946",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011946-51d8aa43332be441",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our commercial and clinical stage products in-licensed from Amgen and others, we rely on the licensors and their manufacturing facilities or their CMOs for the supply of those medicines and drug candidates.",
        "start_character": 74213,
        "end_character": 74423
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011946",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011946-51d8aa43332be441",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Further, our board of directors has adopted a dividend policy which provides that we currently intend to retain all available funds and earnings, if any, to fund the development and expansion of our business, and we do not anticipate paying any cash dividends in the foreseeable future.",
        "start_character": 221518,
        "end_character": 221804
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011946",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011946-51d8aa43332be441",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, as our global business has expanded, we have built substantial organizational capabilities outside of the PRC and have evaluated, designed and implemented business processes and control changes.",
        "start_character": 213015,
        "end_character": 213218
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011946",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011946-51d8aa43332be441",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Starting from the commencement of the Amgen Collaboration Agreement, we and Amgen will co-fund global development costs, with BeOne contributing up to $1.25 billion worth of development services and cash over the term of the collaboration.",
        "start_character": 77024,
        "end_character": 77263
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011946",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011946-51d8aa43332be441",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are developing combination products using our own drug candidates and third-party drugs.",
        "start_character": 106392,
        "end_character": 106483
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011946",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011946-51d8aa43332be441",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are the only company offering potentially best-in-class, foundational medicines across the three key mechanisms of action in CLL, with BRUKINSA, sonrotoclax and our BTK-CDAC.",
        "start_character": 11113,
        "end_character": 11290
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011946",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011946-51d8aa43332be441",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have commercial supply and related agreements with our manufacturing service providers.",
        "start_character": 74019,
        "end_character": 74109
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011946",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011946-51d8aa43332be441",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have manufacturing facilities for small molecule drugs and large molecule biologics in Suzhou and Guangzhou, China, respectively, to support the commercialization and potential future demand of our internally developed or in-licensed products.",
        "start_character": 70349,
        "end_character": 70595
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011946",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011946-51d8aa43332be441",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate in a highly competitive global landscape, with our marketed products facing strong competition in regulated markets worldwide.",
        "start_character": 89531,
        "end_character": 89668
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011946",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011946-51d8aa43332be441",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sometimes rely on trade secrets to protect aspects of our business that are not amenable to, or that we do not consider appropriate for, patent protection, including our manufacturing processes.",
        "start_character": 84483,
        "end_character": 84680
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-011946",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-011946-51d8aa43332be441",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-011946",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With our internal manufacturing capabilities and continued partnership with global contract manufacturers, we continue to diversify our global supply network and, supported by our established strategy to maintain sufficient safety stock of our products, do not anticipate any disruptions to supply.",
        "start_character": 73720,
        "end_character": 74018
      }
